    "title": "LU rallies from 10-run deficit to beat Sam Houston 15-14 in 11 innings - NewsBreak",
    "text": "1 days ago HUNTSVILLE, Texas — Lamar University overcame a 10-run deficit to defeat Sam Houston 15-14 in 11 innings Tuesday night at Don Sanders Stadium. The Cardinals totaled 19 hits, including four home runs, while the pitching staff recorded 16 strikeouts. It marked LU's largest comeback since overcoming a nine-run deficit... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
